The character page already calls `MerchantOperationsEditor.submitAuthoredFields`.
That method passes name, greeting, persona, and knowledge into the existing
`MerchantNPCKnowledgeAuthorFlow`, ingests the AI draft, and stops at original review.
A missing publisher stays unpublished. `recoverFromDraftRead` does not change the phase.
The page shows `merchantNPC.draft.unpublished`.

This branch does not construct a publisher on the page, does not invent a grant,
and does not add a screen.

## Not applied

